ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models
Project Design
1. System Design Overview
ComicCraft is designed as a web-based AI application that converts a user's story idea into a structured comic. The system uses Gemini models to generate story content, characters, scenes, dialogue, narration, and visual prompts.
The overall design follows a modular architecture:
