2. Architectural Design
ComicCraft can follow a three-tier architecture.
Presentation Layer
Responsible for interaction with the user.
Main components:
•	Login/Register
•	Dashboard
•	New Comic page
•	Story generator
•	Character editor
•	Panel editor
•	Comic preview
•	Export page
Application Layer
Responsible for business logic and communication with AI services.
Main components:
•	Authentication service
•	Project service
•	Gemini service
•	Story service
•	Character service
•	Panel service
•	Image service
•	Export service
Data Layer
Responsible for persistent data.
Includes:
•	User database
•	Comic projects
•	Characters
•	Stories
•	Panels
•	Dialogue
•	Image metadata
