7. Gemini AI Module
This is the core module of ComicCraft.
The Gemini service receives structured information from the application and generates comic content.
AI Generation Pipeline
User Idea
    │
    ▼
Prompt Builder
    │
    ▼
Gemini Model
    │
    ▼
Story Structure
    │
    ├── Characters
    ├── Scenes
    ├── Dialogue
    ├── Narration
    └── Visual Prompts
Instead of asking Gemini for an unstructured block of text, the application should request structured output.
Example:
{
  "title": "The Lost Planet",
  "summary": "...",
  "characters": [],
  "scenes": [],
  "panels": []
}
This makes the generated content easier for the backend and frontend to process.
