11. Dialogue Generation
Gemini generates dialogue based on:
•	Character personality
•	Current scene
•	Story context
•	Relationship between characters
•	Emotional situation
Example:
Panel 4

Maya:
"We have to leave before the storm arrives!"

Alex:
"But the signal is coming from inside the ruins."
Users can edit the generated dialogue before finalizing the panel.
________________________________________
12. Visual Generation Design
For each panel, ComicCraft creates a detailed visual prompt.
Example:
Scene:
An abandoned futuristic city at sunset.

Characters:
Maya, wearing a blue space suit.

Action:
Maya walks toward a glowing doorway.

Style:
Colorful cinematic comic-book illustration.

Camera:
Wide shot.
The visual prompt can then be passed to the selected image-generation component, or users can upload an image manually.
