19. Security Design
Important security measures include:
•	Store passwords using secure password hashing when authentication is managed by the application.
•	Keep Gemini/API credentials on the server.
•	Never expose secret API keys in frontend JavaScript.
•	Validate all user input.
•	Authenticate API requests.
•	Authorize access to project IDs.
•	Restrict users from accessing other users' projects.
•	Validate uploaded images/files.
•	Apply rate limits to expensive AI requests.
