24. Design Summary
The central design principle of ComicCraft is to separate AI generation from comic editing. Gemini generates structured creative content, while the application gives the user control to review, modify, arrange, and finalize that content.
The core design can therefore be summarized as:
User Idea → Gemini → Story → Characters → Scenes → Panels → Dialogue/Visuals → Comic Editor → Preview → Export
This architecture also makes the project extensible: additional AI models, image-generation services, comic templates, languages, and export formats can be added without redesigning the entire application.

